        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Houck%2C_Arizona",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town grew when the Atlantic & Pacific Railroad extended tracks along the Rio Puerco in the early 1880s, bringing more settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
